<h1>Capture Rectangular Slot</h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Capture Rectangular Slot allows a datum rectangular slot to be captured using the localiser probe or to be extracted by scanning using the sensor. In case of tactile measurement a plane is necessary where the rectangular slot will lie. This command is accessible from the Localiser Menu Datum &gt; Rect. Slot.</p>
<h2><span lang="EN-GB"><span lang="EN-GB"><span lang="EN-GB"><span lang="EN-US">W</span></span></span>izard</span></h2>
<p><span lang="EN-US">When you select</span> <span class="Path">Datum &gt; Rect. Slot</span> <span lang="EN-US">from the localiser menu the wizard behaves depending on the settings in <a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Capture_Method.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Capture Method (Datum Capture Method)</a> dialog. If Rect Slot listbox is set to</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Prompt</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">the following dialogue will appear:</span></p>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_method.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US">At this stage there are offered 2 possibilities for measuring the rectangular slot:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">If you select<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tactile</b></span>, you will capture the slot using the localiser probe. See <a href="#Capture_Rectangular_Slot_Wizard">Capture Rectangular Slot Wizard</a>.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">If you select <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Scanning</b></span>, you will scan the slot using the sensor. See <a href="#Scan_Rectangular_Slot_Wizard">Scan Rectangular Slot Wizard</a>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&#160;</p>
<h3><span lang="EN-US"><a name="Capture_Rectangular_Slot_Wizard"></a>Capture Rectangular Slot Wizard</span></h3>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When</span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Path" style="font-style:normal;">Tactile</span> <span class="Path" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal;">is selected y</span><span lang="EN-GB">ou will need a plane where the rectangular slot will lay on. KUBE offers two options:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">to capture a plane.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">to use an existing plane or plane reducible entity. If there are existing planes, circles, cylinders, cones, or slots the following dialogue will appear when</span> <span class="Path">Datum &gt; Rect. Slot</span> <span lang="EN-GB">&#160;is selected from the localiser menu:</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/select_plane.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If the ‘Capture 3 or more points to define a plane’ option is selected, the</span> <u><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="Capture_Plane.htm">Capture Plane</a></span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">procedure will start. If one of the existing planes from the list is selected, it will be used for the base of the slot. If there are no existing planes, this dialogue is omitted and the procedure will start immediately to capture a plane.</span></p>
<p class="Note" id="p2"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note 1</b></span>: If Always capture method is used then no dialog for selecting existing plane reducible entities appears but Capture Plane procedure will automatically start. See <span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Capture_Method.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Capture Method (Base Plane Definition)</a> for details.</span></p>
<p class="Note" id="p1"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note 2</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">: KUBE projects the centre of the slot onto the captured (or selected) plane. So even if you use another plane for capturing the slot points, finally the rectangular will lie on the captured (or selected) plane.</span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><span lang="EN-GB">Capture Rectangular Slot</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When the base plane is captured or selected, the slot sides need to be captured in the following order:</span> two or more points to define side 1, one or more points to define side 2 (end), one or more points to define side 3 (opposite side), and one or more points to define side 4 (opposite end).</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a3" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP159958677" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/rect_slot_points.gif" width="510px" height="250px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Capture the points that define the first side of the slot:</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_rectslot_1.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button consecutively to collect the necessary points. Hold</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to delete the last captured point if necessary. Finally press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to finish this side. Captured points are projected onto the plane.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Capture_files/rect_slot1.gif" width="563px" height="108px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When the first side is captured, capture the points that define the second side (next to it) of the slot.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Capture_files/capture_rectslot_2.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button consecutively to collect the necessary points. Hold</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to delete the last captured point if necessary. Finally press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to finish this side. Captured points are projected onto the plane. If only one point is captured then it is projected on side 1 in order to define corner 1, which is common for side 1 and side 2. Otherwise a line is fitted and the corner is the cross point between this line with the line defined for side 1. Side 2 is defined by corner 1 and axis that is orthogonal to side 1 and lies on the plane.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Capture_files/rect_slot2.gif" width="581px" height="174px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When the second side is captured, capture the points that define the third side (next to it) of the slot.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Capture_files/capture_rectslot_3.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button consecutively to collect the necessary points. Hold</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to delete the last captured point if necessary. Finally press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to finish this side. Captured points are projected onto the plane. If only one point is captured then it is projected on side 2 in order to define corner 2, which is common for side 2 and side 3. Otherwise a line is fitted and the corner is the cross point between this line with the line defined for side 2. Side 3 is defined by corner 2 and axis that is orthogonal to side 2 and lies on the plane.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Capture_files/rect_slot3.gif" width="593px" height="183px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When the third side is captured, capture the points that define the fourth side (next to it) of the slot.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Capture_files/capture_rectslot_4.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button consecutively to collect the necessary points. Hold</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to delete the last captured point if necessary. Finally press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to finish. Captured points are projected onto the plane. If only one point is captured then it is projected on side 3 in order to define corner 3, which is common for side 3 and side 4. Otherwise a line is fitted and the corner is the cross point between this line with the line defined for side 3. Side 4 is defined by corner 3 and the axis that is orthogonal to side 3 and lies onto the plane. Corner 4 is the cross point between side 4 and side 1.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Capture_files/rect_slot4.gif" width="600px" height="187px" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">The rectangular slot is defined. Its length is the distance between corner 1 and corner 4 plus the probe diameter. Its width is the distance between corner 1 and corner 2 plus the probe diameter. Slot's normal is parallel to the plane normal and slot's axis is parallel to side 1 and side 3.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Capture_files/rect_slot_elements.gif" width="518px" height="240px" border="0" class="img_whs10" alt=""></span></p>
<p class="Warning"><span lang="EN-GB">A rectangular slot cannot be created if there are less than two captured points for the first side and at least one for the other three sides. In such cases a warning message will appear.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">KUBE will fit a rectangular slot from the set of the captured points. The slot is automatically compensated with the localiser probe. The information about centre, width and height of the resulting slot, and the RMS of fitting will be displayed:</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP160253553" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_rectslot_5.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to reject the resulting rectangular slot or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to create it.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">After finishing the capture procedure, KUBE will issue a dialog, asking you if you will continue capturing rectangular slots.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP159934667" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/continue.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to exit the capture mode or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to continue capturing using</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tactile</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">method.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Bullet">&#160;</p>
<h3><span lang="EN-GB"><a name="Scan_Rectangular_Slot_Wizard"></a>Scan</span> <span lang="EN-US">Rectangular Slot Wizard</span></h3>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When</span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Path" style="font-style:normal;">Scanning</span> <span class="Path" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal;">is selected</span><span lang="EN-GB">, an additional window (which displays the scanned data) will pop-up and the following dialogue will appear:</span></p>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/scan_rect_slot.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to start scanning. Scanning is performed as in the normal</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Scan</u></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode, i.e. after you press</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button KUBE starts capturing a patch and after you press it again KUBE will stop scanning and will enter in</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Pause</u></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a7" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP158926576" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/scan_rect_slot1.gif" width="1280px" height="930px" border="0" class="img_whs11" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">W</span>hen done with the scanning press <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'A'</b></span> button to exit.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>If the extraction is successful you will get:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">the centre of the slot.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">the width and the height of the slot.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">the RMS of the extraction.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Note" id="p3"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: Rectangular slot detection is controlled by <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tolerance</b></span> and <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Depth</b></span> parameters. See <span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Detection_Tolerances.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Detection Tolerances</a></span> <span lang="EN-GB">for details.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a5" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP156727389" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/scan_rect_slot2.gif" width="1280px" height="930px" border="0" class="img_whs11" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to reject the resulting rectangular slot or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to create it.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">After finishing the scan procedure, KUBE will issue a dialog, asking you if you will continue scanning rectangular slots.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a6" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP160296867" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/continue.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to exit the capture mode or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to continue capturing using</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Scanning</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">method.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
